      ],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "A major seasonal weather event led to widespread property and infrastructure damage across the flood-hit regions. The flooding of inhabited areas caused an earthen bridge to collapse, a vital local link gone. Military evacuation operations were launched as a public figure in a shared crisis visited to see the damage firsthand. This shared vulnerability shows how disasters affect everyone, from farmers to schoolchildren.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Everyman",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "result-1",
          "result-2",
          "result-3",
          "result-5"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Severe weather overwhelmed defenses, leading to a bridge failure under pressure and flooding that destroyed homes and schools. The neighboring country stepped in, a diplomatic agreement to adjust water management. Military personnel carrying out water rescues deployed boats for evacuations, a rescue and evacuation effort for ordinary people caught in the disaster. The country's leader visited the flood-hit areas to inspect the agricultural loss and educational disruption firsthand.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Everyman",
